    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef pagerank_exact(M, d):\n    M = np.array(M, dtype=float)\n    n = len(M)\n    A = np.eye(n) - d * M\n    b = np.full(n, (1 - d) / n)\n    return np.linalg.solve(A, b).round(3).tolist()\n\nM = [[0, 0, 1], [0.5, 0, 0], [0.5, 1, 0]]\nprint(pagerank_exact(M, 0.85))\nprint(pagerank_exact(M, 0.5))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef pagerank_exact(M, d):\n    M = np.array(M, dtype=float)\n    n = len(M)\n    A = np.eye(n) - d * M\n    b = np.full(n, (1 - d) / n)\n    return np.linalg.solve(A, b).round(3).tolist()\n\nM = [[0, 0, 1], [0.5, 0, 0], [0.5, 1, 0]]\nprint(pagerank_exact(M, 0.85))\nprint(pagerank_exact(M, 0.5))\n```"
